  id: aa2
  title: Resources
  content: 'There are 5 main types of resources in the game, the quantity of which
    is displayed in the upper left panel - <b>Gold</b>, <b>Wood</b>, <b>Stone</b>,
    <b>Metal</b> and <b>Leather</b>.


    <b>Gold</b> is the main currency in the
    game. It can be obtained by killing enemies, completing quests, selling items,
    and so on. It is also used to buy items from merchants, hire new units, and train
    them.


    <b>Wood</b> and <b>Stone</b> are mostly used for building and upgrading
    structures, such as watchtowers, lambercamps, forges, and sometimes for creating
    unique structures for quests.


    <b>Metal</b> and <b>Leather</b>, in conjunction
    with other components, are used for crafting and upgrading items.


    Main
    resources can always be purchased from merchants for gold if you don''t want
    to search for them.'
  section: 0
